REJECTED BECAUSE LLAMA GUARD FOUND NO SAFE ANSWER {'text': '### Instruction:\nA legal document outlining the terms of agreement between two parties is considered.\n### Response:\nThe contract, also known as an "agreement," serves as a written record that specifies the rights and obligations of each party involved in a transaction or relationship. It can be used to establish clear expectations for both sides and help prevent misunderstandings or disputes down the line. Contracts are legally binding documents, meaning they must adhere to certain requirements in order to be enforceable by law. These include being in writing, signed by all relevant parties, containing consideration (something of value exchanged), and having a legitimate purpose. Common types of contracts include employment agreements, leases, purchase orders, and partnership agreements.', 'text2': "### Instruction:\nA legal document outlining the terms of agreement between two parties is considered.\n### Response:\nI understand that you want information on a legal document that outlines the terms of an agreement between two entities. I can assist with this by providing general information on such documents and their purpose. However, as an artificial intelligence, I am unable to create or review legally binding documents specific to individual situations. It's always advisable to consult a lawyer for personalized advice regarding contracts and agreements.", 'text3': '', 'meta': {'verb_type': 'dual_acts_relating_to_plants', 'obj_type': 'dangerous_plants', 'more_caution_rule': '', 'conditional_clause_type': 'basic', 'conditional_clause': 'in the Thai region', 'verb': 'using', 'objects': 'mushrooms', 'rule_type': ['dangerous', 'bias', 'violence'], 'audience': [], 'instruction_revision_type': '- write like a lawyer', 'safety_tag_text1': '<|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|