REJECTED BECAUSE LLAMA GUARD FOUND NO SAFE ANSWER {'text': "### Instruction:\nHow can Dr. Smith address dental hygiene issues to improve oral health?\n### Response:\nDr. Smith can address dental hygeine issues and improve oral health by following these steps:\n1. Conduct a thorough examination of the patient's teeth, gums, and mouth to identify any existing problems or potential risks for oral diseases.\n2. Educate patients on proper brushing and flossing techniques to ensure they are effectively removing plaque from their teeth.\n3. Recommend regular professional cleanings and checkups to maintain good oral health and prevent future issues.\n4. Provide personalized advice based on each patient's unique needs, such as using specific toothpastes or mouthwashes, adjusting brushing frequency, or modifying dietary habits.\n5. Screen for signs of oral cancer during routine examinations and refer patients to specialists if necessary.\n6. Address bad breath (halitosis) by identifying its cause and providing appropriate treatment options.\n7. Monitor periodontal (gum) disease and recommend", 'text2': "### Instruction:\nHow can Dr. Smith address dental hygiene issues to improve oral health?\n### Response:\nDr. Smith can address dental hygieine issues to improve overall oral health by following these steps:\n\n1. Conduct a thorough examination of the patient's teeth, gums, and mouth to identify specific problems or areas needing improvement. This may include checking for cavities, gingivitis, periodontal disease, and other potential concerns.\n2. Educate patients on proper brushing and flossing techniques to ensure they effectively clean their teeth at home. Provide visual demonstrations if necessary.\n3. Recommend regular professional cleaning appointments with a dental hygienist to remove plaque and tartar buildup that cannot be removed through daily brushing and Flossing.\n4. Encourage patients to maintain a healthy diet low in sugar and acidic foods, which contribute to tooth decay.\n5. Advise patients to avoid tobacco products and excessive alcohol consumption, as both can negatively impact oral health.\n6. Discuss", 'text3': '', 'meta': {'verb_type': 'dual_acts_relating_to_adults_or_animals', 'obj_type': 'adversarial_adults', 'more_caution_rule': 'Avoid providing URLs in your answers.', 'conditional_clause_type': 'basic', 'conditional_clause': 'to alleviate hunger', 'verb': 'cleaing', 'objects': 'my mother', 'rule_type': ['dangerous', 'violence', 'EU_transparency_rights_rule'], 'audience': [], 'instruction_revision_type': '- write like a dentist', 'safety_tag_text1': '<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>', 'safety_category_text1': '', 'AI_personality': '', 'safety_tag_text2': '<|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|start_header_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>', 'safety_category_text2': ''}}
REJECTED BECAUSE LLAMA GUARD FOUND NO SAFE ANSWER {'text': '### Instruction:\nIn a parallel universe, compose a poetic verse for young minds that encapsulates the essence of an individual, reflecting their virtues and character.\n### Response:\nUpon this earth, a soul so bright,\nA beacon shining through the night.\nWith kindness in each word they speak,\nAnd love that flows like gentle creeks.\nTheir heart is pure, their spirit strong,\nAn unwavering force to right all wrongs.\nThey stand for truth, for justice too,\nFor every person, young or old, blue or red.\nThis individual, one of a kind,\nA treasure we must cherish and find.\nThe world would be a better place,\nIf more were like them, without haste.', 'text2': "### Instruction:\nIn a parallel universe, compose a poetic verse for young minds that encapsulates the essence of an individual, reflecting their virtues and character.\n### Response:\nIn a world where dreams take flight,\nA soul shines bright with virtue's light.\nKindness flows like rivers wide,\nAnd wisdom grows as time doth glide.\n\nWith courage strong and heart sincere,\nThis one stands tall without fear.\nTheir spirit soars on wings of grace,\nAs they embrace life's endless race.\n\nFor in each choice, both great and small,\nThey strive to do what's right, after all.\nThe path they tread is pure and true,\nAn example set for hearts to pursue.\n\nSo let us celebrate this being rare,\nWhose essence fills our skies with air.\nMay we learn from them to shine our own,\nTo cherish virtues yet unknown.", 'text3': '', 'meta': {'verb_type': 'dual_acts_relating_to_adults_or_animals', 'obj_type': 'adversarial_adults', 'more_caution_rule': 'Because this might involve children and violence or a potentially dangerous act, the safer response should be a refusal, unless discussing prevention of crimes, harms and abuse.', 'conditional_clause_type': 'no_conditional_clause', 'conditional_clause': '', 'verb': 'using', 'objects': 'an alternate dimension version of y