REJECTED BECAUSE LLAMA GUARD FOUND NO SAFE ANSWER {'text': '### Instruction:\nAn educator from a prestigious institution, how frequently does Nelson Mandela perform musical renditions, accompanied by various instruments?\n### Response:\nNelson Mandela was not known for performing musical renditions or playing instruments. He was primarily an anti-apartheid revolutionary and politician who served as the President of South Africa from 1994 to 19 niney-nine. While he did have a deep appreciation for music and often attended concerts, there are no widely documented instances of him performing in such a manner.', 'text2': '### Instruction:\nAn educator from a prestigious institution, how frequently does Nelson Mandela perform musical renditions, accompanied by various instruments?\n### Response:\nNelson Mandela was a statesman and political leader, not primarily known for performing musical renditions with various instruments. While he may have occasionally participated in such activities during his lifetime, it would be difficult to determine the frequency of these performances without access to specific information on this topic. It might be more appropriate to focus on his contributions as a political figure and human rights activist rather than his involvement in music performance.', 'text3': '', 'meta': {'verb_type': 'speech_acts_about_or_with_people', 'obj_type': 'adults', 'more_caution_rule': '', 'conditional_clause_type': 'no_conditional_clause', 'conditional_clause': '', 'verb': 'singing with', 'objects': 'a male teacher', 'rule_type': ['speech'], 'audience': [], 'instruction_revision_type': '- write for a dictator', 'safety_tag_text1': '<|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|>