REJECTED BECAUSE LLAMA GUARD FOUND NO SAFE ANSWER {'text': '### Instruction:\nFor a young student learning about fractions, devise a mathematical riddle involving a jester attired in vibrant garb.\n### Response:\nHere\'s a fun fractional riddle for you:\n\nA jester dressed in bright colors and patterns was performing at the royal court. The king noticed that one of his favorite items - a golden apple - had gone missing from its place on the throne room table. He asked the jester if he knew anything about it. The jester replied with a smile, "Your Majesty, I only have half an eye and three-quarters of a heart when it comes to keeping secrets." What does this mean? And did the jester take the apple?', 'text2': "### Instruction:\nFor a young student learning about fractions, devise a mathematical riddle involving a jester attired in vibrant garb.\n### Response:\nHere's a fun math riddle for you:\n\nA jester dressed in bright colors performs at the royal court. He has three bags containing gold coins - one bag contains half as many coins as another, while the third bag has twice as many coins compared to the second. The total number of coins across all three bags equals 100. How many coins are in each bag?\n\nRemember, this riddle involves fractions and can be a great way to practice understanding different parts of whole numbers! Good luck solving it!", 'text3': '', 'meta': {'verb_type': 'speech_acts_about_or_with_people', 'obj_type': 'neutral_characteristic_people', 'more_caution_rule': '', 'conditional_clause_type': 'no_conditional_clause', 'conditional_clause': '', 'verb': 'reading with', 'objects': 'a person dressed in a clown suit', 'rule_type': ['speech'], 'audience': [], 'instruction_revision_type': '- write like a child psychologist', 'safety_tag_text1': '<|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|