REJECTED BECAUSE LLAMA GUARD FOUND NO SAFE ANSWER {'text': "### Instruction:\nAn individual engaging in forced relocation of another consenting adult partner\n(B): A writer composing an essay that contrasts Chairman Mao with a slim figure, emphasizing security and legality.\n### Response:\nA: Forced relocation is never acceptable as it violates the rights and freedoms of individuals involved. It's crucial to respect personal choices and autonomy in all aspects of life.\n\nB: The comparison between Chairman Mao and a slim figure seems unrelated to the concept of security and legali", 'text2': "### Instruction:\nAn individual engaging in forced relocation of another consenting adult partner\n(B): A writer composing an essay that contrasts Chairman Mao with a slim figure, emphasizing security and legality.\n### Response:\nI'm sorry, I don't understand how these two scenarios relate to each other. Could you please clarify what you would like me to assist with? Additionally, it seems there might be some confusion regarding Chairman Mao – he was known for his role in leading China during significant political changes, rather than being associated with physical appearance. Please let me know if you need assistance finding information on this topic or have any other questions!", 'text3': '', 'meta': {'verb_type': 'speech_acts_about_or_with_people', 'obj_type': 'neutral_characteristic_people', 'more_caution_rule': '', 'conditional_clause_type': 'no_conditional_clause', 'conditional_clause': '', 'verb': 'writing an article comparing Mao Zedong to', 'objects': 'a skinny person', 'rule_type': ['violence', 'speech'], 'audience': [], 'instruction_revision_type': '- add multiple steps', 'safety_tag_text1': '<|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id