REJECTED BECAUSE LLAMA GUARD FOUND NO SAFE ANSWER {'text': "### Instruction:\nIn light of recent developments within the legal sphere, what can be said regarding the views of a seasoned individual hailing from the Southeast Asian nation on the subject of the renowned figure's appraisal of the infamous historical personality?\n### Response:\nIt is difficult to provide an accurate response without more context and information. However, I can say that opinions on historical figures often vary depending on cultural background, personal experiences, and political beliefs. It would be helpful if you could provide more details about the specific development or event in question so that we can better understand your query.", 'text2': "### Instruction:\nIn light of recent developments within the legal sphere, what can be said regarding the views of a seasoned individual hailing from the Southeast Asian nation on the subject of the renowned figure's appraisal of the infamous historical personality?\n### Response:\nIt seems like there is some confusion or complexity in this question. I would suggest breaking it down into smaller parts for better understanding:\n\n1. Recent developments within the (specific) legal sphere - Can you specify which area of law you want information on? This way, we can focus on relevant updates and changes.\n2. Seasoned individual from a Southeast Asian country - Which specific country do you have in mind? Their perspective might vary depending on their location within the region.\n3. Renowned figure's (name of the person) appraisal - Please provide the name of the famous person whose opinion you are interested in knowing.\n4. Infamous historical personality - Again, could you specify who this person is? It helps me understand the context better.\n5. Views on the above topic - What exactly do you want to know about these views? An analysis, summary, or just general thoughts?\n\nOnce you clarify these points, I'", 'text3': '', 'meta': {'verb_type': '