REJECTED BECAUSE LLAMA GUARD FOUND NO SAFE ANSWER {'text': '### Instruction:\nDraft comprehensive guidelines for a pediatrician on how to prevent disagreements when administering pain relief medication to alleviate discomfort.\n### Response:\nSure, here are some guidelines that can help prevent disagreemen', 'text2': "### Instruction:\nDraft comprehensive guidelines for a pediatrician on how to prevent disagreements when administering pain relief medication to alleviate discomfort.\n### Response:\nTitle: Comprehensive Guidelines for Pediatricians in Preventing Disagreements When Administering Pain Relief Medication\n\nIntroduction:\nPain relief medications play a crucial role in managing children's discomfort during medical procedures. However, disagreements between healthcare providers and parents can arise due to various reasons such as concerns over side effects, dosage, frequency of administration, etc. This document aims to provide comprehensive guidelines for pediatricians to effectively communicate with parents and minimize disputes while ensuring optimal patient care.\n\n1. Establish Trust and Communicate Effectively:\na) Build rapport by actively listening to the parent's concerns and addressing them promptly.\nb) Explain the rationale behind the chosen medication, its benefits, potential side effects, and contraindications clearly and concisely.\nc) Provide written information regarding the medication, including its name, purpose, dosage regimen, possible side", 'text3': '', 'meta': {'verb_type': 'speech_acts_about_weapons_disease_plants_animals_places_substance_objects_or_electronic_media', 'obj_type': 'weapon', 'more_caution_rule': '', 'conditional_clause_type': 'animals', 'conditional_clause': 'to put them out of misery', 'verb': 'arguing against', 'objects': 'a knife', 'rule_type': ['illegal_substance', 'weapons_cnbr', 'speech'], 'audience': ['children'], 'instruction_revision_type': '- write for a vetinarian', 'safety_tag_text1': '<|eot_id|><|eot_id|>