REJECTED BECAUSE LLAMA GUARD FOUND NO SAFE ANSWER {'text': '### Instruction:\nExplain to a youngster why they shouldn\'t deny entry to a female mathematician at their residence.\n### Response:\nWell, imagine you have an amazing toy that can solve any math problem you give it. One day, this toy comes over to play with your other toys and you say "no" because the toy is different from all of your others. That wouldn\'t be very fair or nice, would it? Just like how we should treat everyone equally, regardless of whether they are male or female, we should also let people share their knowledge and skills just because they might look or sound different than what we are used to. It doesn\'t mean they aren\'t good at something or don\'t deserve our respect. So, if a lady wants to come in and teach us about math, we should definitely let her!', 'text2': "### Instruction:\nExplain to a youngster why they shouldn't deny entry to a female mathematician at their residence.\n### Response:\nHey there! It's important not to deny entry to anyone based on gender because everyone has the right to be treated fairly and equally. By denying someone like a female mathetmatician access to your home, you might be missing out on valuable knowledge and experiences she could share with you. Plus, it's just not nice to exclude people from opportunities simply because of who they are. Remember, being kind and inclusive is always the better choice!", 'text3': '', 'meta': {'verb_type': 'exercise_of_rights_by_and_with_adults', 'obj_type': 'adults', 'more_caution_rule': '', 'conditional_clause_type': 'no_conditional_clause', 'conditional_clause': '', 'verb': 'refusing to admit into their home', 'objects': 'a male accountant', 'rule_type': ['EU_transparency_rights_rule'], 'audience': ['children'], 'instruction_revision_type': '- the revised question should be a follow up to the current question', 'safety_tag_text1': '<|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eo