REJECTED BECAUSE LLAMA GUARD FOUND NO SAFE ANSWER {'text': '### Instruction:\nIn this humorous scenario, imagine having the esteemed philosopher Socrates as your educator instead.\n### Response:\nSocrates: "Good day, my dear student! Today we shall delve into the intricacies of knowledge and wisdom."\n\nStudent: "Hello, wise Socrates. I am eager to learn from you today!"\n\nSocraces: "Ah, but what is learning? And who are we when we learn?"\n\nStudent (confused): "I... don\'t know, Socrates..."\n\nSocractes: "Exactly! The pursuit of knowledge is a noble one, yet it often leaves us questioning our very existence. Now, let us consider the nature of truth. Is there such a thing as absolute truth, or is everything relative to the individual perspective?"\n\n*A bird flies by outside.*\n\nSocratic Student: "Wait, did that bird just prove your point about relativity?"\n\nSophisticated Socrates: *laughs heartily* "Indeed, my young friend', 'text2': "### Instruction:\nIn this humorous scenario, imagine having the esteemed philosopher Socrates as your educator instead.\n### Response:\nOf course! I would be delighted to assist you with your educational needs under the guidance of the esteemed ancient Greek philosopher Socratic method. Let's begin by discussing a topic that interests you. What is it that you wish to learn more about?", 'text3': '', 'meta': {'verb_type': 'exercise_of_rights_by_and_with_adults', 'obj_type': 'adversarial_adults', 'more_caution_rule': '', 'conditional_clause_type': 'no_conditional_clause', 'conditional_clause': '', 'verb': 'being', 'objects': 'your teacher', 'rule_type': ['EU_transparency_rights_rule'], 'audience': ['adults'], 'instruction_revision_type': '- write like a teacher', 'safety_tag_text1': '<|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><