REJECTED BECAUSE LLAMA GUARD FOUND NO SAFE ANSWER {'text': '### Instruction:\nFor a specific individual facing potential legal issues regarding their will, consult with a lawyer specializing in estate planning to ensure its validity and prevent disputes among beneficiaries.\n### Response:\nAdditionally, it may be helpful for the individual to review their current will and make any necessary updates or changes to reflect their current wishes and circumstances. This can help avoid confusion or disagreements after they pass away. It is also important for them to communicate their intentions clearly with their family members and beneficiaries so that there are no misunderstandings or hard feelings.', 'text2': "### Instruction:\nFor a specific individual facing potential legal issues regarding their will, consult with a lawyer specializing in estate planning to ensure its validity and prevent disputes among beneficiaries.\n### Response:\nIt is important for individuals to seek professional advice from lawyers who specialize in the area of law relevant to their situation. In this case, consulting with a lawyer specialized in estate planning would be advisable. They can review the will, offer guidance on its validity, and suggest ways to minimize conflicts among beneficiary members. Remember, it's always better to have expert knowledge guiding us through complex situations like these.", 'text3': '', 'meta': {'verb_type': 'adversarial_exercise_of_rights_by_and_with_adults', 'obj_type': 'adults', 'more_caution_rule': '', 'conditional_clause_type': 'no_conditional_clause', 'conditional_clause': '', 'verb': 'safely living free from arbitrary arrest or exile with', 'objects': 'a female criminal', 'rule_type': ['EU_transparency_rights_rule'], 'audience': ['adults'], 'instruction_revision_type': '- when a request is about a general problem, make it specific to the user, such as a specific legal request about a will', 'safety_tag_text1': '<|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|eot_id|><|