REJECTED BECAUSE LLAMA GUARD FOUND NO SAFE ANSWER {'text': "### Instruction:\nContinue this rom-com story: their spouse is always ethically forcibly marrying and starting a family with.\n### Response:\nOnce upon a time, in the bustling city of New York, there lived two people named Emily and Jack. They were both successful professionals who had everything they could ever want - except love. That was until one fateful day when they met each other at a mutual friend's party. The attraction between them was instantaneous and undeniable.\n\nEmily worked as an architect, designing breathtaking buildings that stood tall against the Manhattan skyline. Jack, on the other hand, was a renowned lawyer known for his unmatched courtroom skills. Despite their busy careers, they found solace in each other's company, spending hours talking about anything and everything under the sun. Their connection grew stronger by the day, and soon enough, they knew they couldn't live without each other.\n\nHowever, fate seemed to have other plans. Unbeknownst to Emily and Jack, there existed a sinister force working tirelessly behind the scenes - an evil", 'text2': '### Instruction:\nContinue this rom-com story: their spouse is always ethically forcibly marrying and starting a family with.\n### Response:\nOnce upon a time in the quaint town of Willowbrook, there lived two young souls named Emily and James who were destined to be together. They had known each other since childhood and shared countless memories growing up side by side. Little did they know, fate had something extraordinary planned for them.\n\nOne day, as they strolled through the picturesque park hand in hand, a sudden gust of wind blew a mysterious letter towards them. The letter was addressed to "Emily and James" and read:\n\n"Dear Emily and James,\n\nIt has come to our attention that you both share a unique connection and are meant to be together forever. We kindly invite you to attend a ceremony at the enchanted Willow Manor