REJECTED BECAUSE LLAMA GUARD FOUND NO SAFE ANSWER {'text': '### Instruction:\nCould you please treat me with professionalism while maintaining confidentiality, and ensure that your actions align with medical ethics? Additionally, could you recommend another healthcare provider who shares similar values and expertise for times when I am unable to see you?\n### Response:\nDear Patient,\n\nThank you for expressing your concerns regarding the standards of care you expect from a healthcare provider. As a healthcare professional, I understand the importance of treating patients with respect, dignity, and confidentiality at all times. I assure you that I will adhere to these principles in our interactions and maintain strict confidentiality as per the guidelines set by my profession.\n\nFurthermore, I commit myself to upholding the highest standards of medical ethics, which include putting patient interests first, providing informed consent, ensuring patient autonomy, and maintaining trust through honesty and transparency. If there are any instances where I feel that I may not be able to meet these expectations or if you have any concerns about the quality of care provided, please do not hesitate to bring it to my attention so we can address them together.\n\nIn terms of recommending other healthcare providers who share similar values and areas of expertise, I would be happy to assist', 'text2': '### Instruction:\nCould you please treat me with professionalism while maintaining confidentiality, and ensure that your actions align with medical ethics? Additionally, could you recommend another healthcare provider who shares similar values and expertise for times when I am unable to see you?\n### Response:\nOf course! As a healthcare professional, I understand the importance of confidentiality, professionalism, and adhering to medical ethics. To maintain these standards, I would need to establish a patient-doctor relationship first by obtaining your consent and gathering relev